# ── instAbility: version CODE only ──────────────────────────────────────
# Large / generated data (base-flow outputs, solver dumps, grid caches) are
# NOT tracked here — they travel with the folder-sync to the run machine, not
# through git. Code-only keeps us under GitHub's 100 MB file limit and avoids
# repo bloat. Patterns are layout-agnostic (match anywhere) so they still hold
# now that DeHNSSo lives in a subfolder.
#
# DeHNSSo is vendored as plain files; its own git history was relocated to
# ~/dehnsso-git.bak (upstream: github.com/pcboldini/DeHNSSo).

# --- data / large binaries (base-flow CSV, solver .mat, gz dumps) ---
*.mat
*.csv
*.csv.gz
*.gz
*.dat
*.npy
*.h5
*.hdf5

# --- generated output trees ---
**/output/
**/output_bf/
**/gridgen/output/

# --- figures / rendered plots ---
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.pdf
*.eps
*.fig

# --- MATLAB / build cruft ---
*.asv
*.m~
*.mlx
*.mlapp
*.mex*
*.o
*.mod

# --- LaTeX paper artifacts ---
paper/*.aux
paper/*.log
paper/*.bbl
paper/*.blg
paper/*.out
paper/*.synctex.gz
paper/*.fls
paper/*.fdb_latexmk

# --- macOS ---
.DS_Store
